# ── Exceptions to the blanket *.png rule above ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bundled app ARTWORK is a committed build INPUT, not a build output. It must be in git for two
# reasons: Metro resolves these paths at build time (a missing file breaks the build), and git
# history is the documented way to roll an icon back to a previous version — see the revert ladder
# in sports-explainer-mobile-v2/lib/iconAssets.ts. Without these negations the art would be
# invisible to git and "revert the icon I don't like" would be impossible.
!sports-explainer-mobile-v2/assets/icons/*.png
!sports-explainer-mobile-v2/assets/characters/*.png
!sports-explainer-mobile-v2/assets/coach/*.png

# design spikes (Coach's Corner visual workbench — lives on desk, not in repo)
coaches-corner-spikes/

# build artifact zips
*.zip
